Data availability

            The ERA5 reanalysis data used in this study are publicly available at https://www.ecmwf.int/en/forecasts/dataset/ecmwf-reanalysis-v5 (ref. 52). The ORAS5 SST reanalysis data are publicly available at https://cds.climate.copernicus.eu/datasets/reanalysis-oras5 (ref. 53). The CMIP6 model outputs are publicly available through the Earth System Grid Federation at https://esgf-node.llnl.gov/projects/cmip6 (ref. 38).
